{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Torchlight: Infinite\u2019s \u201cVorax\u201d Season Officially Launches on Jan 15!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Seasonal Mechanic: Vorax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plague known as Vorax is spreading across the continent of Leptis...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters can collect Vorax Substance by defeating infected monsters. Once enough is gathered, head to Dr. Shelley\u2019s Operating Room to begin Surgical Preparation and modify your test subjects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you personally eliminate the custom monstrosities you have created, Dr. Shelley will grant you surprise rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your Ultimate Gear: Graft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond monsters. Graft specific affixes to tailor your perfect Vorax Gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Hero Trait: Vendetta's Sting \u00b7 Erika</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erika Movement is your weapon. Dash to kill with Erika's new trait, Vendetta's Sting. Experience an incredibly fast and fluid playstyle\u2014zip between enemies and deal massive burst damage without ever standing still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Year\u2019s Gift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The New Season Sign-In Event is live! Log in to claim a 10x Battle Pactspirit Draw and an exclusive back accessory. Complete designated objectives to obtain a selectable Battle Pactspirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics Overhaul\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a revamped UI, refreshed character models, and stunning new visual effects. Torchlight is now bigger, bolder, and more immersive than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST &amp; THRILLING Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no stamina and no cooldowns, smash down incoming waves with melee attacks, blast off magical explosions and draining pools, or snipe down ranged enemies. Grind with your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect ENDLESS Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited drops from battles to upgrade build styles and establish your own collection. Prove your grind power by showing off in the in-game free market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build UNLIMITED Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique heroes, 24 talent tabs, 200+ legendary gears, 240+ powerful skills, Try out infinite playstyles or strategic possibilities on hero builds. Build your very own hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade AT WILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Trade house to be a part of a booming economy with an infinite amount of hero builds to trade. One hunter's trash might be another hunter's treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"There were heavy casualties, but we managed to save the Spark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/419abced7113572d56814b1abd0d49b216581f72.jpg"},{"name":"I beat up Keegan in the academy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/0bd1483ed75e4e7c952a3430bcc685f02d0a5061.jpg"},{"name":"I fought a dragon in the desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/7a1336286e8637d6ebce29f721fd14435efc9e8b.jpg"},{"name":"Now I'm finally invincible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/f009b525180199145f6b94ab12b699c6262868f3.jpg"},{"name":"Do you think I can conjure flames out of thin air?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/b11aa6ce5a2212e4a3a8176010e5e8affbdff5a9.jpg"},{"name":"Dreams have everything, and I mean EVERYTHING!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/147245dfbf00bda2101c6e1d407156a681ba53b8.jpg"},{"name":"I'll do anything for Double Corrosion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/f44c4ca655e57aa444bc6655540c01964e5f23d4.jpg"},{"name":"Give me some Ember","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/14001945b38a480acbac583bc5db67da7f7aa352.jpg"},{"name":"You look really handsome when you charge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/8b9b93aa9b053309f4e2cffacbe677d0f1ac9639.jpg"},{"name":"If you're the boss, then who am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1974050/47c41a09590892124fbc444e927ffb6cd9fbb412.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1974050?t=1768448039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768448039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/8762ffbff55d3ef7e13123f274c9c212ae3d3b63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768448039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/8762ffbff55d3ef7e13123f274c9c212ae3d3b63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768448039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US ON DISOCRD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Torchlight: Infinite\u2019s \u201cVorax\u201d Season Officially Launches on Jan 15!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Seasonal Mechanic: Vorax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plague known as Vorax is spreading across the continent of Leptis...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters can collect Vorax Substance by defeating infected monsters. Once enough is gathered, head to Dr. Shelley\u2019s Operating Room to begin Surgical Preparation and modify your test subjects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you personally eliminate the custom monstrosities you have created, Dr. Shelley will grant you surprise rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your Ultimate Gear: Graft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond monsters. Graft specific affixes to tailor your perfect Vorax Gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Hero Trait: Vendetta's Sting \u00b7 Erika</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erika Movement is your weapon. Dash to kill with Erika's new trait, Vendetta's Sting. Experience an incredibly fast and fluid playstyle\u2014zip between enemies and deal massive burst damage without ever standing still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Year\u2019s Gift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The New Season Sign-In Event is live! Log in to claim a 10x Battle Pactspirit Draw and an exclusive back accessory. Complete designated objectives to obtain a selectable Battle Pactspirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics Overhaul\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a revamped UI, refreshed character models, and stunning new visual effects. Torchlight is now bigger, bolder, and more immersive than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/67d82253c361eb5b02c671558f57a2e7.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST &amp; THRILLING Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no stamina and no cooldowns, smash down incoming waves with melee attacks, blast off magical explosions and draining pools, or snipe down ranged enemies. Grind with your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/851b123ea070d8f95d4e20a89e1d87ae.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect ENDLESS Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited drops from battles to upgrade build styles and establish your own collection. Prove your grind power by showing off in the in-game free market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/e543bb5c239fdb074f2c9420f74eb2d2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build UNLIMITED Playstyles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique heroes, 24 talent tabs, 200+ legendary gears, 240+ powerful skills, Try out infinite playstyles or strategic possibilities on hero builds. Build your very own hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/b4e74b6b03adce99bee1182de5e601e2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade AT WILL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Trade house to be a part of a booming economy with an infinite amount of hero builds to trade. One hunter's trash might be another hunter's treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.poster.avif?t=1768448039\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.webm?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/extras/c2a95b58fab4e19a79a4b0c7583728f2.mp4?t=1768448039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["XD"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Since Torchlight Infinite is a cross-platform game on both PC and mobile, the game will require users to bind 3rd party account in order to login like TapTap. ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974050/bac79b8268d5acdef3c0c58781a34fe1fa5f0fe7/header.jpg?t=1768448039","is_free":true,"l